yara4j
======

yara4j is a Java port of YARA 4.5.8 (https://github.com/VirusTotal/yara),
distributed under the BSD 3-Clause license (see LICENSE).

This product includes software developed by third parties, listed below with
their licenses. Only the components bundled in the artifact you distribute
need to be mentioned in your own notices:

- yara4j-core:        YARA (ported), authenticode-parser (ported), TLSH
                      (ported), Bouncy Castle (runtime dependency).
- yara4j-magic-tika:  Apache Tika core, Apache Commons IO, commonmark-java,
                      SLF4J API (runtime dependencies).
- yara4j-cli:         everything above, picocli and SLF4J NOP, all bundled in
                      the shaded jar. The license and notice files of each
                      bundled third-party jar are included unchanged in
                      META-INF/licenses/<artifactId>/ of the shaded jar.


