TLSH
----
com.paveldan.yara4j.util.Tlsh, used by elf.telfhash(), is a port of the TLSH
C implementation bundled with YARA (libyara/tlshc), which derives from TLSH by
Trend Micro (https://github.com/trendmicro/tlsh), dual licensed under the
Apache License 2.0 and the BSD 3-Clause license.


